Z||000004||Oreif||11-05-2001||10:59 PM||||There was a yellow car pic that had the GT tail lights on it. They mounted them and fiberglassed the rear to match. Looked good from the rear but kind of weird from the side. If you want GT tails just get a GT clip and scalap in the sails like the Purple pavement eater. Yes the PPE started life as a GT fastback. Rich chopped the to and scalaped the sails himself.||||reg||1
